  triage:title "peer-config-store.toml over-grants allowed_dependents to non-consumers" ;
  triage:description "boundaries/atm-storage/peer-config-store.toml declares atm-daemon-client and atm-storage-sqlserver-proof as allowed_dependents, but neither crate actually references PeerConfigStore, PeerAliasKey, or PeerDirectory anywhere in source, confirmed by grep. The manifest grants access wider than actual usage." ;
